<p>
  Dear <%= @user.display_login %>,
</p>

<p class="mb-3">
  We received your request for a GitHub Copilot Activity report for <%= @entity_type %> <%= @entity_name %>.
</p>

<p class="mb-3">
  There is currently no activity data available for this <%= @entity_type %>. This could mean:
</p>

<ul class="mb-3">
  <li>No users have been assigned Copilot seats yet</li>
  <li>Assigned users haven't started using Copilot yet</li>
  <li>The reporting period doesn't contain any activity</li>
</ul>

<p class="mb-3">
  If you believe this is incorrect or if you have questions, contact support.
</p>
